---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BookingCalendar from '../../components/BookingCalendar.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Make a Reservation · WINKS London" description="Request a private WINKS London outcall experience using the step-by-step booking calendar.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="page-hero__watermark">BOOK</span><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4 page-hero__content"><div class="breadcrumb-line"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/contact">Contact</a><span>/</span><span class="current">Make a reservation</span></div><span class="eyebrow mt-4">Make a reservation</span><h1>Choose a date.<br /><em>Set the mood.</em></h1><p>A calendar-first booking flow: choose an experience, see its rate, select an available slot and send the request directly to WhatsApp and email.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--line"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="content-grid"><div><BookingCalendar id="booking-reservation" /><p class="form-note mt-3">Rates are pulled from the WINKS London collection page. Transport, Central London taxi costs and any applicable out-of-hours surcharge are confirmed privately before the appointment.</p></div><aside class="content-aside"><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">Calendar approach</span><h3>No back-and-forth.</h3><p>Use the calendar to see the experience, duration, returning-guest rate, date and available time slot in one guided flow.</p><ul class="aside-list"><li>Reserved slots are disabled</li><li>Rates update by experience</li><li>Returning guest pricing</li><li>WhatsApp + email handoff</li></ul></div><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">Need help?</span><p>If you are unsure which experience to choose, email WINKS or call the private line before starting the calendar.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/email-winks">Email WINKS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></aside></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
